WEBVTT

00:00.250 --> 00:07.378
Follow a task from a user's time bucket. Inspect calls, agent lanes, and
cumulative cost. This is synthetic data.

00:08.250 --> 00:14.658
Install ClickHouse and its schema, the OpenTelemetry Collector, and an
authenticated dashboard. Then configure each client.

00:16.250 --> 00:23.330
Agent lanes show calls, tools, and waits. Costs retain their reported or
estimated basis. Capture remains partial.

00:24.250 --> 00:31.258
Select a call to inspect input, output, and cache tokens. Missing fields
stay unavailable. Tokens are not invoices.

00:32.250 --> 00:37.890
Select a model to highlight its calls. Codex diagnostic traces and metrics
do not add to completion costs.

00:40.250 --> 00:47.138
Choose a virtual machine or container platform. Lambda needs runtime
adaptation. Follow the guides for backend prerequisites.
